{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2021-05-05 10:00:00', 'title': 'LILLY TO PARTICIPATE IN BANK OF AMERICA SECURITIES 2021 HEALTH CARE CONFERENCE', 'text': 'INDIANAPOLIS, MAY 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ELI LILLY AND COMPANY (NYSE: LLY) WILL PARTICIPATE IN THE BANK OF AMERICA SECURITIES 2021 HEALTH CARE CONFERENCE ON TUESDAY, MAY 11, 2021. MICHAEL MASON, SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, PRESIDENT OF LILLY DIABETES, WILL PARTICIPATE IN A VIRTUAL FIRESIDE CHAT AT 9:30 A.M.'}